     ##[0m[2m 2. Authentication Header Update
     
     The authentication mechanism has been updated in v2. The `X-Auth-Token` header is no longer supported. All requests must now use a Bearer token in the `Authorization` header. Requests[0m[2m using the old header will receive an HTTP 401 Unauthorized response.
     
     ### Before (v1)
     
[0m[2m```[0m[2m
     X-Auth-Token: <your_api_key>
[0m[2m```
     
     ### After (v2)
     
[0m[2m```[0m[2m
     Authorization: Bearer <your_api_token>
[0m[2m```
     
     ### Code Example
     
     **Before (v1)**
     
     ```[0m[2mpython
     import requests
     
     api_key = "your_v1_api_key"
     headers[0m[2m = {"X-Auth-Token": api_key}
     response = requests.get("https://api.zrb.com/tasks", headers=headers)
[0m[2m```
     
     **After (v2)**
     
     ```[0m[2mpython
