     ## 3. Task ID Type Change
     
     The `id` field for Task objects has changed from an integer to a UUID string. This change affects any operations that reference tasks[0m[2m by their ID, such as `GET /tasks/{id}`, `PUT /tasks/{id}`, and `DELETE /tasks/{id}`.
     
     ### Before (v1)
     
