     {
       "id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef12345678[0m[2m90",
       "title": "Write tests",
       "completed": false,
       "project_id": "proj_abc123",
       "created_at": "2024-0[0m[2m1-15T10:30:00Z"
     }
[0m[2m```
     
